<title>GERMANY: Sixt 1997 H1 profit, sales rise strongly.</title>
<headline>Sixt 1997 H1 profit, sales rise strongly.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of calendar 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    22.6    vs 14.1</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,328   vs 954</p>
<p>Sales breakdown:</p>
<p>    Rental					   444   vs 329</p>
<p>    Sales					    809   vs 576</p>
<p>    Leasing					  95    vs 70</p>
<p>NOTE - Sixt AG said it invested 104 million marks in the first half of 1997 compared to 60 million in the same period of 1996.</p>
</text>
